          "Retrieve a template run: its `status`, rolled up from its outputs, and each output's own status and download URL once completed.",
          "- `template_id` (string, required) \u2014 The template this run executed, so a webhook consumer running several templates can tell their runs apart without keeping a run-to-template map.",
          "- `status` (enum, required) \u2014 The run's status, rolled up from its outputs: `pending` until an output starts, `generating` while any output is unfinished, `completed` once every output has completed, and `failed` once every output has finished and at least one failed. `completed` and `failed` are terminal: the `flows_template_run` webhook fires once the run reaches either."
