            location: "Body (application/json)",
            documented_type: "EffectsSpec-Input, optional, nullable",
            required: false,
            description: "Audio effects applied to the generated audio. Unknown IDs return 404 with `param` naming the field. Reverb (`environment_id` with `send_level` above 0) and a non-zero `pan` produce stereo audio and are rejected with 400 for `ulaw_*`, `alaw_*`, and `pcm_*` output formats. Effects don't change the cost of the request.",
